  "_meta": {
    "note": "CANONICAL SOURCE OF TRUTH for tool pricing data = the moat. Edit this file, then run `python build.py` to inject it into calculator.html + compare.html. DO NOT edit the const TOOLS blocks in those files by hand.",
    "conventions": {
      "opsIncluded": "null = Infinity (unlimited)",
      "workflowLimit": "null = Infinity (unlimited)",
      "monthlyUsd": "null = custom / contact sales (calculator estimates the price at runtime from the largest priced plan, compare renders 'Custom')",
      "note": "calculator-only display label for the plan; omit for custom-priced plans (calculator synthesizes '<name> — price estimated, contact sales')",
      "overage (per-plan)": "optional key on a plan: overrides the tool-level overage; null = this plan has NO pay-as-you-go (engines skip it when ops exceed opsIncluded). Absent key = inherit tool-level.",
      "currency": "monthlyUsd = face value; n8n bills in EUR (annual-billing price recorded, € label in plan note). No FX conversion — a rate change would fake a changelog entry."
    },
    "todo": [
      "pipedream: additional-credit (overage) rate removed from public pricing page (verified 2026-06-13 against saved pricing snapshot) — overage now Contact Sales only, tool-level overage=null; Business=custom tier carries the over-volume estimate. Free 100cr/3wf still exists in-app but is 'discontinued' for new signups.",
      "pipedream: pricing page now also meters AI tokens (Basic 20M/mo, Advanced+Connect 50M/mo) on top of credits — not modeled (we price on credits/ops only); noted in plan notes.",
      "automatisch: Cloud plan removed 2026-06-12 — Elestio managed hosting is the only paid option ($18/mo NC-MEDIUM 2C/4G and up); self-host + VPS remains the modeled cost.",
      "make: vendor renamed operations -> credits (prices unchanged, 1 module action = 1 credit; code execution 2 credits/sec) — watch copy on pages",
      "selfHostHw: VPS hardware cost scales with volume (selfHostHw tiers) — derived from Elestio/Netcup list (NC-MEDIUM 2C/4G $18, NC-LARGE 4C/8G $33, NC-XLARGE 8C/16G $66). Re-check when those list prices move."
